suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99603#pullrequestreview-2520874736","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99603","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2024-12-23T16:28:44Z"},{"id":2520875023,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6WQYAP","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99603#pullrequestreview-2520875023","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99603","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2024-12-23T16:28:51Z"},{"id":2520878794,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6WQY7K","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99603#pullrequestreview-2520878794","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99603","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2024-12-23T16:31:44Z"},{"id":2520878992,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6WQY-Q","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally (rebased on top of `master`), it works as expected.\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\n<details open>\r\n\r\n<summary>Mac specifications</summary>\r\n\r\n- MacBook Pro 16 2024\r\n- **SoC:** M4 Max 16-core CPU, 40-core GPU\r\n- **RAM:** 48 GB\r\n- **SSD:** 1 TB\r\n- **OS:** macOS 15.1.1\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n*Using https://github.com/godotengine/tps-demo with [MetalFX scaling options added](https://github.com/godotengine/tps-demo/pull/196). All tests done in fullscreen at native output resolution (3456x2234).*\r\n\r\nMetalFX performs slightly better than FSR1/2 in upscaling scenarios and generally looks a bit more stable. However, MetalFX temporal scaling lacks a sharpening option, goes for a softer look and has more noticeable stippling artifacts than FSR2, so it may not be to everyone's taste. This softer look has generally been noticed in tests in other games, so it's within expected bounds. The stippling artifacts are more questionable though.\r\n\r\n(This is another reason why games should expose both FSR2 and MetalFX temporal whenever possible.)\r\n\r\n### FSR2 Quality\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1728\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-12-23 at 17 56 15\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9a674a41-d4b7-4ac4-b6cf-84009f766749\" />\r\n\r\n### MetalFX Temporal Quality\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1728\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-12-23 at 17 56 32\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4a2f2bd4-7bc7-4665-984a-d7955b8e16e5\" />\r\n\r\n### Ultra Performance scaling factor\r\n\r\nBilinear | FSR1 | MetalFX Spatial | FSR2 | MetalFX Temporal\r\n-|-|-|-|-\r\n415 FPS (2.40 mspf) | 365 FPS (2.73 mspf) | 386 FPS (2.59 mspf) | 241 FPS (4.14 mspf) | 257 FPS (3.89 mspf)\r\n\r\n### Native scaling factor\r\n\r\nBilinear | FSR2 | MetalFX Temporal\r\n-|-|-\r\n108 FPS (9.25 mspf) | 78 FPS (12.82 mspf) | 77 FPS (12.98 mspf)","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99603#pullrequestreview-2520878992","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99603","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2024-12-23T17:05:40Z"},{"id":2484216167,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6UEiFn","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99603#pullrequestreview-2484216167","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99603","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2024-12-23T17:10:46Z"},{"id":2527844252,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6Wq9ec","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","av